👑🧠 Birbal and the Pot of Wisdom (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked Birbal, “Can you fill this pot with wisdom?”

Birbal smiled and said, “Yes, Your Majesty.”

He took the pot home.

The next day, he returned with the pot covered.

Akbar asked, “Is it full of wisdom?”

Birbal said, “Yes, but you must open it carefully.”

When Akbar opened the pot, he found a pumpkin inside.

He looked confused.

“What does this mean?” he asked.

Birbal explained, “The pumpkin grew inside the pot slowly. Just like wisdom, it takes time and patience to grow.”

Akbar nodded and smiled.

💖 Moral:

Wisdom grows with time and patience.
